  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU diplomatic programme for the enlargement region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(83, 83, 83);&quot;&gt;The Action will set up a diplomatic programme for entry-level diplomats from the IPA III Beneficiaries embedded in the College of Europe and seeking synergies with the EU Diplomatic Academy for diplomats from EU member states. The programme will train these entry-level diplomats in the field of the Union&#xbf;s external action, including the Common Foreign and Security Policy (CFSP), in order to develop and promote a common understanding on the role of the Union in the world as well as disseminate best practices in relation to the conduct of the Union&#xbf;s diplomacy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(83, 83, 83);&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
